    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "At the outset, it is submitted by learned counsel for the petitioner that after hearing the parties to the case by order dated 18.1.2023, the petitioner was directed to be enlarged on provisional bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1196,
      "end": 1398,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18.1.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1324,
          "end": 1333
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "It was further directed that the petitioner will take the O.P. no.2 ie his wife to his place of residence and they will reside together.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1399,
      "end": 1535,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Further, liberty was granted to the parties to Patna High Court CR.\nMISC. No.54840 of 2022(4) dt.22-03-2023 file their respective affidavits bringing on record the developments which have taken place in the meantime.\nLearned counsel for the petitioner as also learned counsel for the O.P. no.2 both submit that no further affidavit has been filed on their behalf.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1536,
      "end": 1899,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Patna High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1583,
          "end": 1599
        },
        {
          "text": "CR.\nMISC. No.54840 of 2022(4)",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1600,
          "end": 1629
        },
        {
          "text": "dt.22-03-2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1630,
          "end": 1643
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "As per instructions received from the respective clients, both the petitioner and the O.P. no.2 are living together.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1900,
      "end": 2016,
