      "end": 2154,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Having heard learned counsel for the parties and taking into consideration the nature of allegation,\nthe petitioner having been enlarged on provisional bail by the above mentioned order dated 18.1.2023 and no adverse affidavit having been filed on behalf of the informant-O.P. no.2 with respect to the developments since grant of the provisional bail, the provisional bail granted to the petitioner vide order dated 18.1.2023 passed in the instant case in connection with Mahila P.S. Case no.18 of 2020 to the satisfaction of learned Additional Sessions Judge XII, Gaya is hereby confirmed on the same terms and conditions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
